{"seq":2,"slug":"oversell-prevent-reconcile","title":"超卖防护与对账兜底","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/flash-safety-capacity/oversell-prevent-reconcile","wordCount":2927,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"超卖防护与对账兜底\">超卖防护与对账兜底</h1><p>前面所有章节都建立在一组假设之上：入口整形会挡住大部分流量、Redis 是可信的、消息不会丢、Lua 脚本会正确执行。这一节主动放弃这组假设，转而假设<strong>每一层都会在某个时刻失效</strong>，然后构造一层不依赖任何前置条件的最终防线。</p>\n<p>这个转向不是多余的谨慎，而是有工程依据的：Lua 脚本可能有边界 bug、Redis 可能在主从切换时丢写入、分片扣减的实现可能有 off-by-one、回滚可能被调用两次、运维可能误删 key。这些失效模式的共同点是<strong>它们都不会立刻暴露</strong>——超卖直到日终对账或者用户投诉才会被发现。因此防线的设计目标不是「让超卖不发生」，而是「让超卖一旦发生就被尽快发现，且发现后能被安全地止血和补偿」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-多层防线与它们的失效假设\">核心概念：多层防线与它们的失效假设</h2><p>超卖防护是纵深防御，每一层都假设上一层已经失效。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>防的是什么</th>\n<th>失效时会怎样</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>L1</td>\n<td>内存扣减原子性（Lua）</td>\n<td>并发竞态导致的多扣</td>\n<td>超卖，且立即发生</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L2</td>\n<td>数据库条件更新</td>\n<td>L1 的边界 bug、逻辑错误</td>\n<td>超卖被数据库拒绝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L3</td>\n<td>实时水位校验</td>\n<td>累计扣减超过快照总量</td>\n<td>触发告警与熔断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>L4</td>\n<td>日终对账</td>\n<td>以上全部失效后的兜底</td>\n<td>发现差异，止血+补偿</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前三层是<strong>预防</strong>，第四层是<strong>检测与修复</strong>。一个只有前三层没有第四层的系统，在任意一层出 bug 时都不知道自己出了 bug。反过来，只有 L4 而没有前三层也不成立——对账发现超卖时，货已经卖出去几千单了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[秒杀请求] --&gt; B[L1 Redis Lua 原子扣减]&#10;  B --&gt;|成功| C[L2 数据库条件更新&lt;br/&gt;UPDATE ... WHERE available &gt;= qty]&#10;  B --&gt;|失败| Z[快速失败]&#10;  C --&gt;|影响行数=0| D[超卖被拦截&lt;br/&gt;告警+回滚 Redis]&#10;  C --&gt;|影响行数=1| E[订单成立]&#10;  C --&gt;|影响行数=1| F[L3 实时水位校验&lt;br/&gt;累计扣减 vs 快照总量]&#10;  F --&gt;|正常| G[继续]&#10;  F --&gt;|超阈值| H[熔断该商品&lt;br/&gt;人工介入]&#10;  E --&gt; I[L4 日终对账]&#10;  I --&gt;|无差异| J[收尾]&#10;  I --&gt;|有差异| K[止血 → 补偿 → 复盘]\">graph TD\n  A[秒杀请求] --&gt; B[L1 Redis Lua 原子扣减]\n  B --&gt;|成功| C[L2 数据库条件更新&lt;br/&gt;UPDATE ... WHERE available &gt;= qty]\n  B --&gt;|失败| Z[快速失败]\n  C --&gt;|影响行数=0| D[超卖被拦截&lt;br/&gt;告警+回滚 Redis]\n  C --&gt;|影响行数=1| E[订单成立]\n  C --&gt;|影响行数=1| F[L3 实时水位校验&lt;br/&gt;累计扣减 vs 快照总量]\n  F --&gt;|正常| G[继续]\n  F --&gt;|超阈值| H[熔断该商品&lt;br/&gt;人工介入]\n  E --&gt; I[L4 日终对账]\n  I --&gt;|无差异| J[收尾]\n  I --&gt;|有差异| K[止血 → 补偿 → 复盘]</pre><h2 id=\"l2-数据库条件更新作为第二重闸门\">L2：数据库条件更新作为第二重闸门</h2><p>L1 已经把扣减放在 Redis 的原子脚本里了，为什么还需要 L2？</p>\n<p>因为 L1 的正确性依赖于「脚本本身是对的」。脚本可能错在：分片扣减时准入判断用了错误的分片、回滚时把库存加到了错误的分片、某个边界条件下跳过了库存检查。这些错误的应用层代码无法自查，但数据库可以——因为数据库持有的是<strong>与 Redis 结构不同的第二份数据</strong>，一个在 Redis 侧正确的 bug 未必能同时骗过数据库侧。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE sku_stock&#10;   SET available = available - :qty,&#10;       sold      = sold + :qty,&#10;       version   = version + 1&#10; WHERE sku_id = :sku_id&#10;   AND activity_id = :activity_id&#10;   AND available &gt;= :qty&#10;RETURNING available, sold, version;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_stock</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       sold      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :sku_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :activity_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">RETURNING available, sold, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>WHERE available &gt;= :qty</code> 是这个语句的全部力量所在。它是数据库层面的条件更新：如果库存不足，影响行数为 0，事务不会修改任何数据。这不需要任何额外的锁（<code>UPDATE</code> 自带行锁），也不依赖应用层的判断——<strong>即使应用层完全算错了要扣多少，数据库也只会扣到 0 为止</strong>。</p>\n<p>关键设计点是 <code>RETURNING</code> 为空时的处置：<strong>不能静默忽略，也不能简单重试</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>静默忽略 → 超卖被掩盖，只在日志里消失；</li>\n<li>简单重试 → 如果是持续性的库存不足，重试会无限循环；</li>\n<li>正确处置 → 记录一次「L1 与 L2 不一致」事件，回滚 Redis 侧的扣减，向用户返回售罄，并<strong>告警</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个事件是极其有价值的诊断信号：它意味着 Redis 认为够扣而数据库认为不够。两种可能——Redis 库存高于数据库（Redis 多算了，原因可能是回滚加多了、预热写错了、或者有人直接改了数据库），或者数据库库存低于预期（可能有人绕过秒杀系统直接下单）。无论哪种，都需要人工排查。</p>\n<h3 id=\"回滚-redis-时的顺序\">回滚 Redis 时的顺序</h3><p>发现 L2 拦截后要回滚 Redis 的扣减（见<a href=\"../cache-stock-deduct/redis-lua-atomic-deduct\">Redis 原子预扣与 Lua 脚本</a>的回滚脚本）。顺序上有一个选择：先回滚 Redis 还是先记事件？</p>\n<p>答案是<strong>先记事件</strong>。理由是：如果先回滚 Redis 再记事件，而记录过程崩溃，那么这次不一致就永远不会被发现（Redis 已经恢复一致，看起来一切正常）。反过来先记事件再回滚，最坏情况是记了一条事件但回滚失败——这时 Redis 少了一份库存（少卖），会被后续的巡检和对账发现并修复。<strong>记录优先于修复</strong>，因为未记录的修复等于未发现问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"l3-实时水位校验\">L3：实时水位校验</h2><p>L2 拦截的是「单次扣减不合理」，L3 拦截的是「累计扣减不合理」。</p>\n<p>实时水位校验的思路是把「累计已扣减量」与「预热快照总量」做比较，超过阈值就熔断：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>水位</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>sold</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>frozen</mtext></mrow><mtext>flash_qty</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{水位} = \\frac{\\text{sold} + \\text{frozen}}{\\text{flash\\_qty}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">水位</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3674em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">flash_qty</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sold</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">frozen</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>正常情况下这个比值单调增长且不超过 1。如果超过 1（哪怕只超出 0.1%），说明有库存被凭空创造——这是必须立即熔断的信号。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>水位范围</th>\n<th>判定</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 0.8</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.8 – 0.99</td>\n<td>接近售罄</td>\n<td>关注，准备售罄标志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.99 – 1.0</td>\n<td>售罄临界</td>\n<td>触发售罄快速失败</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 1.0</td>\n<td>超卖发生</td>\n<td>熔断该商品，告警，人工介入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>突然跳变</td>\n<td>异常</td>\n<td>熔断并检查是否有代码发布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行「突然跳变」是水位校验里最有价值的检测：如果水位在一秒内从 0.3 跳到 0.9，那不是正常的购买速度，而是某个地方一次性减了很多库存——可能是运维误操作、可能是回滚逻辑批量执行、也可能是某个补偿任务重跑。<strong>水位的增长率比水位的绝对值更能揭示问题</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE stock_watermark (&#10;  activity_id  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id       TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  flash_qty    BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  sold_qty     BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  frozen_qty   BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  sampled_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (activity_id, sku_id, sampled_at)&#10;);&#10;&#10;SELECT activity_id, sku_id,&#10;       (sold_qty + frozen_qty)::numeric / NULLIF(flash_qty, 0) AS watermark,&#10;       (sold_qty + frozen_qty) - lag(sold_qty + frozen_qty)&#10;         OVER (PARTITION BY activity_id, sku_id ORDER BY sampled_at) AS delta_qty,&#10;       sampled_at - lag(sampled_at)&#10;         OVER (PARTITION BY activity_id, sku_id ORDER BY sampled_at) AS delta_t&#10;  FROM stock_watermark&#10; WHERE sampled_at &gt; now() - interval &#39;1 minute&#39;&#10; ORDER BY watermark DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> stock_watermark</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  activity_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  flash_qty    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sold_qty     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  frozen_qty   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sampled_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (activity_id, sku_id, sampled_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_id, sku_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (sold_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frozen_qty)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(flash_qty, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> watermark,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       (sold_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frozen_qty) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sold_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frozen_qty)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_id, sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sampled_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta_qty,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       sampled_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sampled_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_id, sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sampled_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta_t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_watermark</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sampled_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 minute'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> watermark </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>窗口函数 <code>lag</code> 给出相邻采样的差分，<code>delta_qty / delta_t</code> 就是水位增长率。这个查询可以以秒级频率对全部活动商品执行，一次扫描就能列出所有异常——这是窗口函数在处理时序指标时最典型的用法，也是把它放进本节而不是别处的原因：水位校验的价值就在于<strong>实时</strong>，而窗口函数是实时聚合的现成工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"l4-日终对账与补偿\">L4：日终对账与补偿</h2><p>前三层都是「在线」的，它们只能看到当前的状态。日终对账是「离线」的，它以订单数据为锚，反过来验证库存链路是否自洽。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对账要回答的三个问题\">对账要回答的三个问题</h3><p><strong>问题一：总量是否守恒？</strong> 对每个 <code>(activity_id, sku_id)</code> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">sold + frozen + available</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">so</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">oz</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ai</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ab</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 是否等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">flash\\_qty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。不守恒说明有库存被创造或消灭。</p>\n<p><strong>问题二：订单是否都有对应的扣减？</strong> 每笔成立订单（<code>state IN (&#39;CREATED&#39;,&#39;PAID&#39;,...)</code>）都应该在 <code>stock_flow</code> 里有一条 <code>CONFIRMED</code> 记录。缺失说明订单侵占了未扣减的库存（超卖的一种）。</p>\n<p><strong>问题三：扣减是否都有对应的订单？</strong> 每条 <code>DEDUCTED</code> 状态的流水都应该在超时窗口内变成 <code>CONFIRMED</code> 或 <code>ROLLED_BACK</code>。长期停留在 <code>DEDUCTED</code> 说明库存被卡住（少卖）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 问题二：成立订单缺少 CONFIRMED 流水（潜在超卖）&#10;SELECT o.activity_id, o.sku_id, COUNT(*) AS orphan_orders, SUM(o.qty) AS orphan_qty&#10;  FROM orders o&#10;  LEFT JOIN stock_flow f ON f.order_id = o.order_id AND f.state = &#39;CONFIRMED&#39;&#10; WHERE o.created_at::date = :biz_date&#10;   AND o.state IN (&#39;CREATED&#39;, &#39;PAID&#39;, &#39;SHIPPED&#39;, &#39;COMPLETED&#39;)&#10;   AND f.order_id IS NULL&#10; GROUP BY o.activity_id, o.sku_id&#10;HAVING COUNT(*) &gt; 0;&#10;&#10;-- 问题三：长期 DEDUCTED 未推进（库存卡住）&#10;SELECT activity_id, sku_id, COUNT(*) AS stuck_flows, SUM(qty) AS stuck_qty&#10;  FROM stock_flow&#10; WHERE state = &#39;DEDUCTED&#39;&#10;   AND deduct_at &lt; now() - interval &#39;30 minutes&#39;&#10; GROUP BY activity_id, sku_id;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 问题二：成立订单缺少 CONFIRMED 流水（潜在超卖）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">activity_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orphan_orders, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">qty</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orphan_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_flow f </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CONFIRMED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">created_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :biz_date</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CREATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAID'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SHIPPED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'COMPLETED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">activity_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 问题三：长期 DEDUCTED 未推进（库存卡住）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_id, sku_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stuck_flows, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(qty) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stuck_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stock_flow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DEDUCTED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deduct_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'30 minutes'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> activity_id, sku_id;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两个查询的输出就是<strong>差异清单</strong>。差异清单本身就是对账的产物，它的完整形态应该被落库（而不是只在告警里），因为补偿动作需要引用它、复盘需要统计它。这与<a href=\"../cache-stock-deduct/cache-db-stock-consistency\">缓存与数据库库存最终一致</a>里把状态落进 <code>stock_flow</code> 表是同一套思路：<strong>可追溯的记录让补偿成为可能，也让复盘成为可能</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"补偿的顺序-止血-补偿-复盘\">补偿的顺序：止血 → 补偿 → 复盘</h3><p><strong>止血</strong>优先于补偿。发现超卖时的第一反应不应该是「怎么把多卖的订单取消」，而是「怎么阻止继续超卖」。止血动作包括：关闭该活动的入口（设置售罄标志）、熔断该商品的扣减、降低全局准入速率。</p>\n<p><strong>补偿</strong>分两种情形，处置方式完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>补偿方式</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超卖（多卖）</td>\n<td>orphan_orders &gt; 0</td>\n<td>与用户协商取消/改期，或从其他渠道补货</td>\n<td>用户信任损失，需客服介入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>少卖（库存卡住）</td>\n<td>stuck_flows 大量</td>\n<td>把 DEDUCTED 流水回滚，归还库存</td>\n<td>低（库存本来就没卖出去）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>超卖的补偿<strong>必须有人工介入</strong>。技术上可以自动取消超额订单，但订单取消涉及用户权益、可能触发投诉、可能需要补偿方案，这些都不是代码能决定的。系统能做的是：精确定位哪些订单是超卖的（按扣减时间排序，最后成交的那些）、生成一份可操作的清单、并把它们标记为「待人工处理」，交给订单取消流程处理。</p>\n<p>少卖的补偿相对安全：把卡住的流水回滚、归还库存，不涉及用户。但必须体现幂等（同一流水只能回滚一次）与上界检查（归还后不超过初始库存），这两点正是<a href=\"../cache-stock-deduct/redis-lua-atomic-deduct\">Redis 原子预扣与 Lua 脚本</a>回滚脚本要处理的。</p>\n<p><strong>复盘</strong>的产出应该回答：超卖发生在哪一层（哪一层的防线失效了）、失效的原因是什么、以及需要补上哪一层。如果复盘结论是「L1 有 bug」，那么修 L1 之后要重跑对账验证；如果结论是「L2 的拦截被静默忽略了」，那么这是一个流程问题而不是代码问题，需要在代码评审与告警配置上处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"对账的执行频率\">对账的执行频率</h3><p>日终对账听起来是「一天一次」，但对于大促，这个频率太低了——一天一次意味着超卖可能持续几个小时才被发现。秒杀场景的实践是<strong>分层频率</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>实时</strong>（秒级）：L3 水位校验，覆盖「明显异常」；</li>\n<li><strong>准实时</strong>（分钟级）：对账问题二（orphan_orders），覆盖「订单与扣减不匹配」；</li>\n<li><strong>日终</strong>（天级）：完整的三问题对账 + 差异清单落库 + 财务口径核对。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三层频率对应三种失败速度：越快的检查覆盖越明显的异常，越慢的检查覆盖越隐蔽的异常。这个分层与<a href=\"../cache-stock-deduct/cache-db-stock-consistency\">缓存与数据库库存最终一致</a>里「正常消费 / 巡检 / 日终」三条收敛路径是同构的——<strong>不同时间尺度上有不同密度的一致性检查</strong>，是分布式系统保持最终一致的通用手法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>超卖防护是纵深防御：L1 内存原子性、L2 数据库条件更新、L3 实时水位校验、L4 日终对账；前三层预防，第四层检测与修复。</li>\n<li>L2 的 <code>WHERE available &gt;= qty</code> 是数据库层面的第二重闸门，它不依赖应用层判断；<code>RETURNING</code> 为空时不能静默忽略，必须记录、回滚 Redis、并告警。</li>\n<li>发现 L2 拦截时应<strong>先记事件再回滚</strong>——未记录的修复等于未发现问题。</li>\n<li>L3 用窗口函数计算水位增长率，水位的跳变比绝对值更能揭示异常；超过 1.0 必须熔断并人工介入。</li>\n<li>L4 对账回答三个问题：总量是否守恒、订单是否都有扣减、扣减是否都有订单；差异清单必须落库可追溯。</li>\n<li>补偿顺序是止血 → 补偿 → 复盘；超卖补偿需人工介入，少卖补偿可自动但必须幂等并有上界检查。</li>\n<li>对账频率分层：实时水位、准实时订单匹配、日终完整对账；三层对应三种失败速度。</li>\n<li>参考：PostgreSQL 官方文档关于窗口函数 <code>lag</code> 的语义（postgresql.org/docs/current/functions-window.html）；Google SRE 关于对账与「检测优先于修复」的可靠性实践（sre.google/sre-book/）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>防线与对账都到位了，还剩最后一个问题：这套系统在真实峰值下能撑多少，以及这些防线在压力下还灵不灵，见<a href=\"capacity-plan-drill\">容量评估与全链路压测演练</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"超卖防护与对账兜底","id":"超卖防护与对账兜底"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：多层防线与它们的失效假设","id":"核心概念-多层防线与它们的失效假设"},{"level":2,"text":"L2：数据库条件更新作为第二重闸门","id":"l2-数据库条件更新作为第二重闸门"},{"level":3,"text":"回滚 Redis 时的顺序","id":"回滚-redis-时的顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"L3：实时水位校验","id":"l3-实时水位校验"},{"level":2,"text":"L4：日终对账与补偿","id":"l4-日终对账与补偿"},{"level":3,"text":"对账要回答的三个问题","id":"对账要回答的三个问题"},{"level":3,"text":"补偿的顺序：止血 → 补偿 → 复盘","id":"补偿的顺序-止血-补偿-复盘"},{"level":3,"text":"对账的执行频率","id":"对账的执行频率"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"秒杀价、预算与限购","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/flash-safety-capacity/flash-price-quota-limit"},"next":{"title":"容量评估与全链路压测演练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/flash-sale-high-concurrency-gateway/flash-safety-capacity/capacity-plan-drill"}}